15","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1002/ajae.12015"},{"t":"Multiplying the efficiency and impact of biofortification through metabolic engineering","a":["Dominique Van Der Straeten","Navreet K. Bhullar","Hans De Steur","Wilhelm Gruissem","Donald MacKenzie","Wolfgang Pfeiffer","Matin Qaim","Inez Slamet-Loedin","Simon Strobbe","Joe Tohme","Kurniawan Rudi Trijatmiko","Hervé Vanderschuren","Marc Van Montagu","Chunyi Zhang","Howarth Bouis"],"y":2020,"c":"pub","j":"Nature Communications","v":"11","i":"1","r":150,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-020-19020-4","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1038/s41467-020-19020-4"},{"t":"New plant breeding technologies for food security","a":["Syed Shan-e-Ali Zaidi","Hervé Vanderschuren","Matin Qaim","Magdy M. Mahfouz","Ajay Kohli","Shahid Mansoor","Mark Tester"],"y":2019,"c":"pub","j":"Science","v":"363","i":"6434","p":"1390-1391","r":139,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aav6316","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1126/science.aav6316"},{"t":"Production diversity and dietary diversity in smallholder farm households","a":["Kibrom T. Sibhatu","Vijesh V. Krishna","Matin Qaim"],"y":2015,"c":"pub","j":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences","v":"112","i":"34","p":"10657-10662","r":141,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1510982112","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1073/pnas.1510982112"},{"t":"Reply to Berti: Relationship between production and consumption diversity remains small also with modified diversity measures","a":["Kibrom T. Sibhatu","Vijesh V. Krishna","Matin Qaim"],"y":2015,"c":"pub","j":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences","v":"112","i":"42","r":141,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1517209112","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1073/pnas.1517209112"},{"t":"Reply to Remans et al.: Strengthening markets is key to promote sustainable agricultural and food systems","a":["Kibrom T. Sibhatu","Vijesh V. Krishna","Matin Qaim"],"y":2015,"c":"pub","j":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences","v":"112","i":"45","r":141,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1519045112","